  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, then the points of discontinuity of the function <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> where <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></math> (<math><mi>n</mi></math> times) are",
