  "solution": {
    "text": "Clearly, <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a point of discontinuity of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.<br />if <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> which is discontinuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mo> </mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br />Which is continuous everywhere.<br />Hence, <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which is continuous everywhere.<br />So, the only points of discontinuity are <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />&nbsp;",
